---
title: Implementation Attempt · one gate approval, fenced code cycles, one candidate
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant gate as Implementation Gate
  participant cp as Implementation controller
  box Vercel Sandbox · fenced by the lease
    participant codex as Codex · GPT-6.1 Sol
    participant ws as Workspace checkout
  end
  participant build as Candidate build

  gate->>cp: approved_live · frozen scope + budgets
  cp->>cp: lock the Product Signal, recheck, commit<br/>attempt + dispatch intent atomically
  cp->>ws: claim the prepared workspace under the lease
  Note over ws: A later attempt uses a fresh workspace holding<br/>the newest ready Preview Version's files.
  loop Each cycle, within scope + budgets
    cp->>codex: codex exec · task + cited files
    codex->>ws: scoped search, exact reads, bounded edits
    codex-->>cp: final report · event stream read after the run
    cp->>ws: format the changed files
    par Checks
      cp->>ws: required checks against the baseline · scope check
    and Build
      cp->>build: build from the same staged files
    end
    opt New failure or mechanical violation
      cp-->>codex: correction cycle
    end
  end
  cp->>build: accept the candidate, collected under the lease
  Note over build: Preview Build publishes<br/>the Preview Version.
